RIM Comprehensive Example
RIM Demonstrates multiple features

ECKO ========================================
ECKO   Batch-Inspired Language Demo
ECKO ========================================
ECKO

RIM Initialize variables
SEP username = User
SEP version = 1.0

ECKO Welcome %username% to version %version%
ECKO

RIM Menu loop
:menu
ECKO --- Menu ---
ECKO 1. Variables Test
ECKO 2. Conditionals Test
ECKO 3. Exit
ECKO

RIM Simulate choosing option 1
SEP choice = 1

IZ %choice% == 1 GOTA variables_test
IZ %choice% == 2 GOTA conditionals_test
IZ %choice% == 3 GOTA exit

GOTA menu

:variables_test
ECKO
ECKO Testing Variables...
SEP name = John Doe
SEP email = john@example.com
ECKO Name: %name%
ECKO Email: %email%
GOTA done

:conditionals_test
ECKO
ECKO Testing Conditionals...
SEP status = OK
IZ %status% == OK ECKO Status check passed!
IZ %status% != ERROR ECKO No errors detected
GOTA done

:done
ECKO
ECKO Test complete!
GOTA exit

:exit
ECKO
ECKO Thank you for using the interpreter!
ECKO Exiting...
EXIS 0
